    "text": ["エンジニアは大変だね。"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "綾",
    "speakerSub": "AYA",
    "text": ["えっ、そういうことしちゃうの！？　わるい子だ！"]
  },
    {
    "speaker": "落露",
    "speakerSub": "RAKURO",
    "text": ["……。"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "綾",
    "speakerSub": "AYA",
